{"content": "<!-- awi-geo-start -->\n<h2>Berapa harga BYD Atto 1 di Makassar?</h2>\n<p>Harga OTR BYD Atto 1 di Makassar mulai Rp213.000.000. BYD Atto 1 adalah mobil listrik hatchback kompak untuk mobilitas harian di kota, tersedia dalam 3 tipe, dan dijual resmi oleh BYD Haka Karebosi Makassar, dealer resmi BYD dan Denza di Jl. Ahmad Yani No. 15, Makassar, Sulawesi Selatan. Semua harga di bawah adalah harga on the road (OTR) Makassar. Stok terbatas, harga terbaik bulan ini.</p>\n<h2>Tipe dan harga OTR BYD Atto 1 Makassar</h2>\n<ul><li><strong>BYD Atto 1 Standard</strong>: Rp213.000.000 OTR Makassar</li><li><strong>BYD Atto 1 Dynamic</strong>: Rp224.000.000 OTR Makassar</li><li><strong>BYD Atto 1 Premium</strong>: Rp260.000.000 OTR Makassar</li></ul>\n<h2>Test drive dan simulasi kredit BYD Atto 1 di Makassar</h2>\n<p>Showroom BYD Haka Karebosi Makassar buka Senin sampai Sabtu pukul 08.00 sampai 17.00 WITA dan Minggu pukul 09.00 sampai 17.00 WITA. Untuk jadwal test drive, simulasi kredit, atau cek stok BYD Atto 1, hubungi Sales Consultant AWI lewat <a href=\"https://wa.me/6282259452349?text=Halo%20Kak%20AWI%2C%20saya%20mau%20tanya%20harga%20OTR%20dan%20test%20drive%20BYD%20Atto%201%20di%20Makassar.\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">WhatsApp 0822-5945-2349</a>.</p>\n<p><strong>Bandingkan harga model BYD lain di Makassar:</strong> <a href=\"https://byd-makassar.id/model/byd-dolphin/\">Harga BYD Dolphin Makassar</a> · <a href=\"https://byd-makassar.id/model/byd-atto-3/\">Harga BYD Atto 3 Makassar</a> · <a href=\"https://byd-makassar.id/model/byd-m6/\">Harga BYD M6 Makassar</a> · <a href=\"https://byd-makassar.id/model/byd-m6-dm/\">Harga BYD M6 DM Makassar</a> · <a href=\"https://byd-makassar.id/model/byd-seal/\">Harga BYD Seal Makassar</a> · <a href=\"https://byd-makassar.id/model/byd-sealion-7/\">Harga BYD Sealion 7 Makassar</a> · <a href=\"https://byd-makassar.id/model/byd-denza-d9/\">Harga Denza D9 Makassar</a>. Lihat juga <a href=\"https://byd-makassar.id/harga-byd-makassar/\">daftar harga semua mobil BYD Makassar 2026</a>.</p>\n<!-- awi-geo-end -->\n\n<!-- awi-faq-start -->\n<h2 style=\"margin-top:24px;\">FAQ BYD Atto 1 Makassar</h2>\n<h3 style=\"margin:16px 0 6px;\">Berapa harga OTR BYD Atto 1 di Makassar?</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 12px;line-height:1.6;\">Harga OTR BYD Atto 1 di Makassar: Standard Rp213 juta, Dynamic Rp224 juta, dan Premium Rp260 juta. Harga sudah on the road Makassar di dealer resmi BYD Haka Karebosi. Stok terbatas, harga terbaik bulan ini, jadi cek ketersediaan warna dulu sebelum datang ke showroom.</p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:16px 0 6px;\">Apa beda BYD Atto 1 Standard, Dynamic, dan Premium?</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 12px;line-height:1.6;\">Perbedaan utamanya ada di kapasitas baterai, jarak tempuh, dan kelengkapan fitur. Untuk pengisian cepat DC, tipe Dynamic mendukung hingga 30 kW dan Premium hingga 40 kW. Penjelasan lengkap per tipe ada di artikel <a href=\"https://byd-makassar.id/perbedaan-varian-byd-atto-1-standard-dynamic-premium/\">perbedaan varian BYD Atto 1 Standard, Dynamic, Premium</a>.</p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:16px 0 6px;\">Apakah BYD Atto 1 cocok dipakai harian di Makassar?</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 12px;line-height:1.6;\">Cocok. Bodi hatchback kompak bikin gampang parkir dan bermanuver di jalanan padat Makassar, dan baterainya cukup di-charge di rumah malam hari, jadi tidak perlu antre BBM lagi. Pajak tahunan mobil listrik juga jauh lebih ringan dibanding mobil bensin sekelas berkat insentif kendaraan listrik. Hitung sendiri penghematannya di <a href=\"https://byd-makassar.id/kalkulator-hemat/\">Kalkulator Hemat BBM vs Listrik</a>.</p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:16px 0 6px;\">Berapa garansi baterai BYD Atto 1?</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 12px;line-height:1.6;\">BYD Atto 1 memakai Blade Battery LFP buatan BYD dengan garansi baterai 8 tahun atau 160.000 km (mana yang tercapai lebih dulu, S&amp;K berlaku). Servis dan klaim garansi bisa dilakukan langsung di dealer resmi BYD Haka Karebosi Makassar.</p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:16px 0 6px;\">Bisa kredit BYD Atto 1 di Makassar?</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 12px;line-height:1.6;\">Bisa, lewat leasing resmi rekanan dealer dengan pilihan DP dan tenor yang fleksibel. Coba hitung angsurannya di halaman <a href=\"https://byd-makassar.id/simulasi-kredit/\">Simulasi Kredit BYD Makassar</a>, lalu konfirmasi angka final ke Sales Consultant AWI.</p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:16px 0 6px;\">Di mana test drive BYD Atto 1 di Makassar?</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 12px;line-height:1.6;\">Test drive BYD Atto 1 tersedia di showroom BYD Haka Karebosi, Jl. Ahmad Yani No. 15 Makassar. Buka Senin sampai Sabtu 08.00 sampai 17.00 WITA dan Minggu 09.00 sampai 17.00 WITA. Daftar lewat <a href=\"https://byd-makassar.id/test-drive/\">form test drive</a> atau chat AWI di <a href=\"https://wa.me/6282259452349?text=Halo%20Kak%20AWI%2C%20saya%20mau%20test%20drive%20BYD%20Atto%201%20di%20Makassar.\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">WhatsApp 0822-5945-2349</a>.</p>\n<!-- awi-faq-end -->\n\n<p style=\"margin:30px 0 4px;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#1d5fa8;font-weight:600\">BYD Atto 1 · Energy in Motion</p><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:30px;line-height:1.25;color:#111111\">Sporty. Efficient. Electric. Mobil Listrik Harian untuk Makassar</h2><img src=\"https://byd-makassar.id/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/byd-atto-1-sporty-efficient.webp\" alt=\"BYD Atto 1 warna Sprout Green dan Apricity White di dealer resmi BYD Haka Karebosi Makassar\" width=\"1400\" height=\"824\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:2000px;height:auto;border-radius:10px;margin:0 auto 14px\" /><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;line-height:1.75;color:#333;font-size:16px\"><a href=\"https://byd-makassar.id/model/byd-atto-1/\"><strong>BYD Atto 1</strong></a> adalah hatchback listrik kompak dengan desain aerodinamis yang sporty, dibuat untuk mobilitas harian di kota. Bodinya ringkas sehingga lincah di jalanan padat Makassar dan gampang diparkir, sementara kabinnya tetap nyaman untuk 5 penumpang.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;line-height:1.75;color:#333;font-size:16px\">Jarak tempuh hingga 380 km (NEDC), bisa dicas cepat DC hingga 40 kW, dan biaya harian jauh lebih hemat dari mobil bensin. Harga OTR Makassar mulai <strong>Rp213.000.000</strong>. Stok terbatas, harga terbaik bulan ini.</p><a href=\"https://wa.me/6282259452349?text=Halo%20Kak%20AWI%2C%20saya%20lihat%20halaman%20BYD%20Atto%201%20di%20website%20BYD%20Makassar.%20Mau%20tanya%20harga%20OTR%20dan%20jadwal%20test%20drive.\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:inline-block;background:#16a34a;color:#fff;padding:13px 22px;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;margin:0 10px 10px 0\">Chat AWI untuk Test Drive Atto 1</a><a href=\"https://byd-makassar.id/simulasi-kredit/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:inline-block;background:#111111;color:#fff;padding:13px 22px;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;margin:0 10px 10px 0\">Simulasi Kredit</a>\n<p style=\"margin:40px 0 4px;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#1d5fa8;font-weight:600\">Harga</p><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:26px;line-height:1.3;color:#111111\">Tipe dan Harga OTR BYD Atto 1 Makassar</h2>\n<div style=\"overflow-x:auto;margin:0 0 10px\"><table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:15px;background:#fff\"><tr><th style=\"text-align:left;padding:10px 12px;background:#111111;color:#fff;font-size:15px\">Tipe</th><th style=\"text-align:left;padding:10px 12px;background:#111111;color:#fff;font-size:15px\">Harga OTR Makassar</th><th style=\"text-align:left;padding:10px 12px;background:#111111;color:#fff;font-size:15px\">Ciri utama</th></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;vertical-align:top\"><strong>BYD Atto 1 Standard</strong></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;vertical-align:top\"><strong>Rp213.000.000</strong></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;vertical-align:top\">Tipe paling terjangkau untuk mulai pakai mobil listrik. Detail spesifikasi tanyakan ke AWI.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;vertical-align:top\"><strong>BYD Atto 1 Dynamic (Standard Range)</strong></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;vertical-align:top\"><strong>Rp224.000.000</strong></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;vertical-align:top\">Baterai 30,08 kWh, jarak 300 km NEDC, DC 30 kW</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;vertical-align:top\"><strong>BYD Atto 1 Premium (Long Range)</strong></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;vertical-align:top\"><strong>Rp260.000.000</strong></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;vertical-align:top\">Baterai 38,88 kWh, jarak 380 km NEDC, DC 40 kW, airbag samping, wireless charging, jok pengemudi elektrik, setir tilt &amp; telescopic</td></tr></table></div>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-size:13px;color:#777;line-height:1.5\">Harga OTR Makassar sesuai pricelist resmi dan dapat berubah sewaktu-waktu. Penjelasan lengkap tiap tipe ada di artikel <a href=\"https://byd-makassar.id/perbedaan-varian-byd-atto-1-standard-dynamic-premium/\">perbedaan BYD Atto 1 Standard, Dynamic, Premium</a>.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:40px 0 4px;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#1d5fa8;font-weight:600\">Desain</p><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:26px;line-height:1.3;color:#111111\">Sleek. Sporty. Intelligent.</h2><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;line-height:1.75;color:#333;font-size:16px\">Wajah depan yang dibentuk untuk berkendara modern, garis samping bergaya crossover yang dinamis, dan lampu LED yang tegas.</p>\n<img src=\"https://byd-makassar.id/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/byd-atto-1-tampak-depan.webp\" alt=\"Tampak depan BYD Atto 1 Sleek Sporty Intelligent\" width=\"1400\" height=\"379\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:2000px;height:auto;border-radius:10px;margin:0 auto 14px\" />\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:14px;margin:0 0 4px\"><div style=\"flex:1 1 260px;min-width:0\"><figure style=\"margin:0 0 14px\"><img src=\"https://byd-makassar.id/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/byd-atto-1-side-crossover.webp\" alt=\"Desain samping crossover BYD Atto 1\" width=\"813\" height=\"367\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:813px;height:auto;border-radius:10px;margin:0 auto 6px\" /><figcaption style=\"font-size:14px;color:#555;line-height:1.5\"><strong>Side crossover</strong>, garis dinamis untuk gaya urban.</figcaption></figure></div><div style=\"flex:1 1 260px;min-width:0\"><figure style=\"margin:0 0 14px\"><img src=\"https://byd-makassar.id/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/byd-atto-1-velg-16-inci.webp\" alt=\"Velg alloy 16 inci BYD Atto 1\" width=\"808\" height=\"367\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:808px;height:auto;border-radius:10px;margin:0 auto 6px\" /><figcaption style=\"font-size:14px;color:#555;line-height:1.5\"><strong>Velg alloy 16 inci</strong>, cengkeraman kuat dan tampilan tajam.</figcaption></figure></div></div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:14px;margin:0 0 4px\"><div style=\"flex:1 1 260px;min-width:0\"><figure style=\"margin:0 0 14px\"><img src=\"https://byd-makassar.id/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/byd-atto-1-lampu-led.webp\" alt=\"Lampu depan LED otomatis BYD Atto 1\" width=\"813\" height=\"412\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:813px;height:auto;border-radius:10px;margin:0 auto 6px\" /><figcaption style=\"font-size:14px;color:#555;line-height:1.5\"><strong>Lampu LED otomatis</strong> untuk pandangan yang jelas.</figcaption></figure></div><div style=\"flex:1 1 260px;min-width:0\"><figure style=\"margin:0 0 14px\"><img src=\"https://byd-makassar.id/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/byd-atto-1-lampu-belakang.webp\" alt=\"Lampu belakang LED satu bilah BYD Atto 1\" width=\"808\" height=\"412\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:808px;height:auto;border-radius:10px;margin:0 auto 6px\" /><figcaption style=\"font-size:14px;color:#555;line-height:1.5\"><strong>Lampu belakang LED satu bilah</strong> dengan lampu rem atas LED.</figcaption></figure></div></div>\n<p style=\"margin:40px 0 4px;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#1d5fa8;font-weight:600\">Kabin</p><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:26px;line-height:1.3;color:#111111\">Smart Comfort Inside</h2><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;line-height:1.75;color:#333;font-size:16px\">Interior lega dan rapi yang dirancang supaya setiap perjalanan terasa nyaman dan praktis.</p>\n<img src=\"https://byd-makassar.id/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/byd-atto-1-interior.webp\" alt=\"Interior dan dashboard BYD Atto 1\" width=\"1400\" height=\"916\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:2000px;height:auto;border-radius:10px;margin:0 auto 14px\" />\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:14px;margin:0 0 4px\"><div style=\"flex:1 1 260px;min-width:0\"><figure style=\"margin:0 0 14px\"><img src=\"https://byd-makassar.id/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/byd-atto-1-kabin.webp\" alt=\"Kabin depan BYD Atto 1\" width=\"809\" height=\"504\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:809px;height:auto;border-radius:10px;margin:0 auto 6px\" /><figcaption style=\"font-size:14px;color:#555;line-height:1.5\"><strong>Precision-crafted smart cabin</strong>, perpaduan teknologi dan kenyamanan.</figcaption></figure></div><div style=\"flex:1 1 260px;min-width:0\"><figure style=\"margin:0 0 14px\"><img src=\"https://byd-makassar.id/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/byd-atto-1-jok-sport.webp\" alt=\"Jok sport kulit sintetis BYD Atto 1\" width=\"809\" height=\"504\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:809px;height:auto;border-radius:10px;margin:0 auto 6px\" /><figcaption style=\"font-size:14px;color:#555;line-height:1.5\"><strong>Jok sport kulit sintetis</strong> yang menopang dengan baik.</figcaption></figure></div></div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:14px;margin:0 0 4px\"><div style=\"flex:1 1 260px;min-width:0\"><figure style=\"margin:0 0 14px\"><img src=\"https://byd-makassar.id/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/byd-atto-1-bagasi.webp\" alt=\"Bagasi BYD Atto 1 230 liter hingga 930 liter\" width=\"809\" height=\"487\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:809px;height:auto;border-radius:10px;margin:0 auto 6px\" /><figcaption style=\"font-size:14px;color:#555;line-height:1.5\"><strong>Bagasi 230 liter</strong>, bisa diperluas hingga 930 liter dengan kursi belakang dilipat.</figcaption></figure></div><div style=\"flex:1 1 260px;min-width:0\"><figure style=\"margin:0 0 14px\"><img src=\"https://byd-makassar.id/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/byd-atto-1-kompartemen.webp\" alt=\"Kompartemen penyimpanan di kabin BYD Atto 1\" width=\"809\" height=\"487\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:809px;height:auto;border-radius:10px;margin:0 auto 6px\" /><figcaption style=\"font-size:14px;color:#555;line-height:1.5\"><strong>Banyak ruang simpan</strong> di kabin untuk HP, botol minum, dan barang kecil.</figcaption></figure></div></div>\n<p style=\"margin:40px 0 4px;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#1d5fa8;font-weight:600\">Teknologi</p><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:26px;line-height:1.3;color:#111111\">Drive Bold. Live Bright.</h2><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;line-height:1.75;color:#333;font-size:16px\">Fitur pintar yang bikin hidup harian lebih praktis, dari layar sentuh 10,1 inci sampai kunci digital di HP.</p>\n<img src=\"https://byd-makassar.id/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/byd-atto-1-drive-bold.webp\" alt=\"BYD Atto 1 Sprout Green melaju di jalan kota\" width=\"1400\" height=\"592\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:2000px;height:auto;border-radius:10px;margin:0 auto 14px\" />\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:14px;margin:0 0 4px\"><div style=\"flex:1 1 180px;min-width:0\"><figure style=\"margin:0 0 14px\"><img src=\"https://byd-makassar.id/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/byd-atto-1-instrumen-7-inci.webp\" alt=\"Panel instrumen digital 7 inci BYD Atto 1\" width=\"550\" height=\"396\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:550px;height:auto;border-radius:10px;margin:0 auto 6px\" /><figcaption style=\"font-size:14px;color:#555;line-height:1.5\"><strong>Panel instrumen digital 7 inci</strong></figcaption></figure></div><div style=\"flex:1 1 180px;min-width:0\"><figure style=\"margin:0 0 14px\"><img src=\"https://byd-makassar.id/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/byd-atto-1-layar-10-1-inci.webp\" alt=\"Layar sentuh 10,1 inci BYD Atto 1 dengan Apple CarPlay dan Android Auto\" width=\"525\" height=\"396\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:525px;height:auto;border-radius:10px;margin:0 auto 6px\" /><figcaption style=\"font-size:14px;color:#555;line-height:1.5\"><strong>Layar sentuh 10,1 inci</strong> dengan Apple CarPlay &amp; Android Auto (wireless &amp; USB)</figcaption></figure></div><div style=\"flex:1 1 180px;min-width:0\"><figure style=\"margin:0 0 14px\"><img src=\"https://byd-makassar.id/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/byd-atto-1-nfc-digital-key.webp\" alt=\"NFC digital key BYD Atto 1\" width=\"542\" height=\"396\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:542px;height:auto;border-radius:10px;margin:0 auto 6px\" /><figcaption style=\"font-size:14px;color:#555;line-height:1.5\"><strong>NFC digital key</strong>, buka mobil cukup dengan HP</figcaption></figure></div></div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:14px;margin:0 0 4px\"><div style=\"flex:1 1 180px;min-width:0\"><figure style=\"margin:0 0 14px\"><img src=\"https://byd-makassar.id/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/byd-atto-1-wireless-charging.webp\" alt=\"Wireless charging BYD Atto 1 Premium\" width=\"550\" height=\"400\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:550px;height:auto;border-radius:10px;margin:0 auto 6px\" /><figcaption style=\"font-size:14px;color:#555;line-height:1.5\"><strong>Wireless charging</strong> (tipe Premium)</figcaption></figure></div><div style=\"flex:1 1 180px;min-width:0\"><figure style=\"margin:0 0 14px\"><img src=\"https://byd-makassar.id/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/byd-atto-1-tilt-telescopic.webp\" alt=\"Setir tilt dan telescopic BYD Atto 1 Premium\" width=\"525\" height=\"400\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:525px;height:auto;border-radius:10px;margin:0 auto 6px\" /><figcaption style=\"font-size:14px;color:#555;line-height:1.5\"><strong>Setir tilt &amp; telescopic</strong> (tipe Premium)</figcaption></figure></div><div style=\"flex:1 1 180px;min-width:0\"><figure style=\"margin:0 0 14px\"><img src=\"https://byd-makassar.id/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/byd-atto-1-jok-elektrik.webp\" alt=\"Jok pengemudi elektrik 6 arah BYD Atto 1 Premium\" width=\"542\" height=\"400\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:542px;height:auto;border-radius:10px;margin:0 auto 6px\" /><figcaption style=\"font-size:14px;color:#555;line-height:1.5\"><strong>Jok pengemudi elektrik 6 arah</strong> (tipe Premium)</figcaption></figure></div></div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:14px;margin:0 0 4px\"><div style=\"flex:1 1 180px;min-width:0\"><figure style=\"margin:0 0 14px\"><img src=\"https://byd-makassar.id/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/byd-atto-1-voice-command.webp\" alt=\"Voice command bahasa Indonesia BYD Atto 1\" width=\"550\" height=\"400\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:550px;height:auto;border-radius:10px;margin:0 auto 6px\" /><figcaption style=\"font-size:14px;color:#555;line-height:1.5\"><strong>Voice command</strong> bahasa Indonesia &amp; Inggris</figcaption></figure></div><div style=\"flex:1 1 180px;min-width:0\"><figure style=\"margin:0 0 14px\"><img src=\"https://byd-makassar.id/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/byd-atto-1-kamera-mundur.webp\" alt=\"Kamera mundur dan 3 radar BYD Atto 1\" width=\"525\" height=\"400\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:525px;height:auto;border-radius:10px;margin:0 auto 6px\" /><figcaption style=\"font-size:14px;color:#555;line-height:1.5\"><strong>Kamera mundur</strong> dengan 3 radar belakang</figcaption></figure></div><div style=\"flex:1 1 180px;min-width:0\"><figure style=\"margin:0 0 14px\"><img src=\"https://byd-makassar.id/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/byd-atto-1-byd-app.webp\" alt=\"Aplikasi BYD App untuk BYD Atto 1\" width=\"542\" height=\"400\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:542px;height:auto;border-radius:10px;margin:0 auto 6px\" /><figcaption style=\"font-size:14px;color:#555;line-height:1.5\"><strong>BYD App</strong> untuk cek dan kontrol mobil dari HP</figcaption></figure></div></div>\n<p style=\"margin:40px 0 4px;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#1d5fa8;font-weight:600\">Performa &amp; Keamanan</p><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:26px;line-height:1.3;color:#111111\">Power Meets Peace of Mind</h2><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;line-height:1.75;color:#333;font-size:16px\">Performa responsif berpadu dengan sistem keselamatan modern, supaya Anda percaya diri di jalan.</p>\n<img src=\"https://byd-makassar.id/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/byd-atto-1-v2l-piknik.webp\" alt=\"BYD Atto 1 dipakai untuk santai dan V2L di depan rumah\" width=\"1400\" height=\"566\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:2000px;height:auto;border-radius:10px;margin:0 auto 14px\" />\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;margin:6px 0 18px\"><div style=\"flex:1 1 140px;padding:16px;border:1px solid #cfe0f3;border-radius:10px;background:#f3f8fd;text-align:center\"><div style=\"font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#777\">Tenaga maksimum</div><div style=\"font-size:30px;font-weight:700;color:#111111;line-height:1.2\">55<span style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:500;color:#555\"> kW</span></div></div><div style=\"flex:1 1 140px;padding:16px;border:1px solid #cfe0f3;border-radius:10px;background:#f3f8fd;text-align:center\"><div style=\"font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#777\">Torsi maksimum</div><div style=\"font-size:30px;font-weight:700;color:#111111;line-height:1.2\">135<span style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:500;color:#555\"> Nm</span></div></div><div style=\"flex:1 1 140px;padding:16px;border:1px solid #cfe0f3;border-radius:10px;background:#f3f8fd;text-align:center\"><div style=\"font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#777\">0–50 km/jam</div><div style=\"font-size:30px;font-weight:700;color:#111111;line-height:1.2\">4,9<span style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:500;color:#555\"> detik</span></div></div></div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:14px;margin:0 0 4px\"><div style=\"flex:1 1 180px;min-width:0\"><figure style=\"margin:0 0 14px\"><img src=\"https://byd-makassar.id/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/byd-atto-1-powerful.webp\" alt=\"BYD Atto 1 tenaga 55 kW torsi 135 Nm\" width=\"554\" height=\"496\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:554px;height:auto;border-radius:10px;margin:0 auto 6px\" /><figcaption style=\"font-size:14px;color:#555;line-height:1.5\"><strong>Powerful:</strong> tenaga 55 kW dan torsi 135 Nm.</figcaption></figure></div><div style=\"flex:1 1 180px;min-width:0\"><figure style=\"margin:0 0 14px\"><img src=\"https://byd-makassar.id/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/byd-atto-1-quick-response.webp\" alt=\"Akselerasi BYD Atto 1 0-50 km/jam 4,9 detik\" width=\"525\" height=\"496\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:525px;height:auto;border-radius:10px;margin:0 auto 6px\" /><figcaption style=\"font-size:14px;color:#555;line-height:1.5\"><strong>Quick response:</strong> 0–50 km/jam dalam 4,9 detik, pas untuk lalu lintas kota.</figcaption></figure></div><div style=\"flex:1 1 180px;min-width:0\"><figure style=\"margin:0 0 14px\"><img src=\"https://byd-makassar.id/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/byd-atto-1-dc-fast-charging.webp\" alt=\"DC fast charging BYD Atto 1\" width=\"546\" height=\"496\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:546px;height:auto;border-radius:10px;margin:0 auto 6px\" /><figcaption style=\"font-size:14px;color:#555;line-height:1.5\"><strong>DC fast charging</strong> 30 kW (Dynamic) dan 40 kW (Premium).</figcaption></figure></div></div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:14px;margin:0 0 4px\"><div style=\"flex:1 1 180px;min-width:0\"><figure style=\"margin:0 0 14px\"><img src=\"https://byd-makassar.id/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/byd-atto-1-vehicle-to-load.webp\" alt=\"Fitur Vehicle to Load 2,2 kW BYD Atto 1\" width=\"554\" height=\"487\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:554px;height:auto;border-radius:10px;margin:0 auto 6px\" /><figcaption style=\"font-size:14px;color:#555;line-height:1.5\"><strong>Vehicle to Load 2,2 kW</strong>, bisa menyalakan peralatan listrik saat piknik atau mati lampu.</figcaption></figure></div><div style=\"flex:1 1 180px;min-width:0\"><figure style=\"margin:0 0 14px\"><img src=\"https://byd-makassar.id/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/byd-atto-1-rangka-kuat.webp\" alt=\"Rangka bodi berkekuatan tinggi BYD Atto 1\" width=\"525\" height=\"487\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:525px;height:auto;border-radius:10px;margin:0 auto 6px\" /><figcaption style=\"font-size:14px;color:#555;line-height:1.5\"><strong>Rangka bodi berkekuatan tinggi</strong> untuk perlindungan penumpang.</figcaption></figure></div><div style=\"flex:1 1 180px;min-width:0\"><figure style=\"margin:0 0 14px\"><img src=\"https://byd-makassar.id/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/byd-atto-1-e-platform.webp\" alt=\"e-Platform 3.0 BYD Atto 1\" width=\"546\" height=\"246\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:546px;height:auto;border-radius:10px;margin:0 auto 6px\" /><figcaption style=\"font-size:14px;color:#555;line-height:1.5\"><strong>e-Platform 3.0</strong>, platform khusus mobil listrik BYD.</figcaption></figure></div></div>\n<figure style=\"margin:0 0 14px\"><img src=\"https://byd-makassar.id/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/byd-atto-1-blade-battery.webp\" alt=\"BYD Blade Battery pada BYD Atto 1\" width=\"546\" height=\"233\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:546px;height:auto;border-radius:10px;margin:0 auto 6px\" /><figcaption style=\"font-size:14px;color:#555;line-height:1.5\"><strong>BYD Blade Battery</strong> dengan sistem kontrol suhu baterai.</figcaption></figure>\n<p style=\"margin:40px 0 4px;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#1d5fa8;font-weight:600\">Efisiensi</p><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:26px;line-height:1.3;color:#111111\">Effortless Efficiency, Every Drive</h2><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;line-height:1.75;color:#333;font-size:16px\">Banyak cara membuka mobil, pengisian daya cepat, dan biaya harian yang rendah, semuanya dalam satu mobil listrik pintar.</p>\n<img src=\"https://byd-makassar.id/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/byd-atto-1-efisien.webp\" alt=\"BYD Atto 1 mobil listrik hemat untuk harian di kota\" width=\"1400\" height=\"795\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:2000px;height:auto;border-radius:10px;margin:0 auto 14px\" />\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:14px;margin:0 0 4px\"><div style=\"flex:1 1 260px;min-width:0\"><figure style=\"margin:0 0 14px\"><img src=\"https://byd-makassar.id/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/byd-atto-1-port-ccs2.webp\" alt=\"Port pengisian DC CCS2 BYD Atto 1\" width=\"813\" height=\"512\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:813px;height:auto;border-radius:10px;margin:0 auto 6px\" /><figcaption style=\"font-size:14px;color:#555;line-height:1.5\"><strong>Port DC CCS2</strong>, fast charging 30 kW (Dynamic) dan 40 kW (Premium). Pengisian AC di rumah hingga 6,6 kW.</figcaption></figure></div><div style=\"flex:1 1 260px;min-width:0\"><figure style=\"margin:0 0 14px\"><img src=\"https://byd-makassar.id/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/byd-atto-1-regen-braking.webp\" alt=\"Sistem regenerative braking BYD Atto 1\" width=\"821\" height=\"487\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:821px;height:auto;border-radius:10px;margin:0 auto 6px\" /><figcaption style=\"font-size:14px;color:#555;line-height:1.5\"><strong>Coordinated regenerative braking</strong>, energi pengereman diubah kembali jadi listrik.</figcaption></figure></div></div>\n<figure style=\"margin:0 0 14px\"><img src=\"https://byd-makassar.id/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/byd-atto-1-biaya-rendah.webp\" alt=\"BYD Atto 1 biaya harian dan perawatan rendah\" width=\"813\" height=\"487\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:813px;height:auto;border-radius:10px;margin:0 auto 6px\" /><figcaption style=\"font-size:14px;color:#555;line-height:1.5\"><strong>Biaya harian dan perawatan rendah.</strong> Tidak perlu ganti oli mesin, dan biaya listrik per km jauh di bawah bensin. Hitung sendiri di <a href=\"https://byd-makassar.id/kalkulator-hemat/\">Kalkulator Hemat BBM vs Listrik</a>.</figcaption></figure>\n<p style=\"margin:40px 0 4px;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#1d5fa8;font-weight:600\">Keselamatan</p><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:26px;line-height:1.3;color:#111111\">Fitur Keselamatan BYD Atto 1</h2>\n<ul style=\"margin:0 0 16px 20px;padding:0;line-height:1.8;color:#333\"><li>Airbag depan dan airbag tirai depan-belakang di semua tipe; airbag samping depan di tipe Premium</li><li>Kamera mundur dengan 3 radar belakang, Auto Hold, dan rem parkir elektrik</li><li>ABS, ESC, TCS, EBD, Hill-Start Assist, Hydraulic Brake Assist, dan TPMS</li><li>Cruise control, ISOFIX di kursi belakang sisi luar, dan pengingat sabuk pengaman depan-belakang</li></ul>\n<p style=\"margin:40px 0 4px;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#1d5fa8;font-weight:600\">Pilihan Warna</p><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:26px;line-height:1.3;color:#111111\">Warna BYD Atto 1</h2><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;line-height:1.75;color:#333;font-size:16px\">3 warna eksterior: <strong>Sprout Green</strong>, <strong>Apricity White</strong>, dan <strong>Cosmos Black</strong>. Interior two-tone Black + Grey.</p>\n<img src=\"https://byd-makassar.id/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/byd-atto-1-pilihan-warna.webp\" alt=\"Pilihan warna BYD Atto 1 Sprout Green, Apricity White, Cosmos Black\" width=\"858\" height=\"229\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:858px;height:auto;border-radius:0px;margin:0 auto 14px\" />\n<p style=\"margin:40px 0 4px;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#1d5fa8;font-weight:600\">Spesifikasi</p><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:26px;line-height:1.3;color:#111111\">Spesifikasi BYD Atto 1 Dynamic &amp; Premium</h2>\n<div style=\"overflow-x:auto;margin:0 0 10px\"><table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:15px;background:#fff\"><tr><th colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:left;padding:10px 12px;background:#111111;color:#fff;font-size:15px\">Dimensi</th></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:9px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;vertical-align:top;color:#555;width:52%\">Panjang x Lebar x Tinggi</td><td style=\"padding:9px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;vertical-align:top\"><strong>3.925 x 1.720 x 1.590 mm</strong></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:9px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;vertical-align:top;color:#555;width:52%\">Jarak sumbu roda</td><td style=\"padding:9px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;vertical-align:top\"><strong>2.500 mm</strong></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:9px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;vertical-align:top;color:#555;width:52%\">Jarak pijak depan / belakang</td><td style=\"padding:9px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;vertical-align:top\"><strong>1.500 / 1.485 mm</strong></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:9px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;vertical-align:top;color:#555;width:52%\">Radius putar minimum</td><td style=\"padding:9px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;vertical-align:top\"><strong>4,95 m</strong></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:9px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;vertical-align:top;color:#555;width:52%\">Ground clearance (berbeban)</td><td style=\"padding:9px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;vertical-align:top\"><strong>155 mm</strong></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:9px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;vertical-align:top;color:#555;width:52%\">Velg &amp; ban</td><td style=\"padding:9px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;vertical-align:top\"><strong>Alloy 16 inci, 185/55 R16</strong></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:9px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;vertical-align:top;color:#555;width:52%\">Berat kosong</td><td style=\"padding:9px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;vertical-align:top\"><strong>Dynamic 1.225 kg · Premium 1.280 kg</strong></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:9px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;vertical-align:top;color:#555;width:52%\">Bagasi</td><td style=\"padding:9px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;vertical-align:top\"><strong>230 L (hingga 930 L dengan kursi belakang dilipat)</strong></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:9px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;vertical-align:top;color:#555;width:52%\">Kapasitas penumpang</td><td style=\"padding:9px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;vertical-align:top\"><strong>5 orang</strong></td></tr><tr><th colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:left;padding:10px 12px;background:#111111;color:#fff;font-size:15px\">Motor &amp; Performa</th></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:9px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;vertical-align:top;color:#555;width:52%\">Motor</td><td style=\"padding:9px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;vertical-align:top\"><strong>Permanent Magnet Sync